 "but that\[CloseCurlyQuote]s not important here. Also note the arrows are \
implicit: always down.)\nInternally a ",
 StyleBox["Tree", "Input"],
 " data structure is stored by nesting:\n (for more details on this data \
structure, see below)"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.972536949968358*^9, 3.9725369560894957`*^9}, {
