Cell[TextData[{
 "There is a general formula in Foissy, which this can be compared to.\nNow \
some more generic but related comments. \n\nWe can construct binary \
operations by ",
 StyleBox["Groupings", "Input"],
 ".\nFor example, on four ordered elements ",
 StyleBox["a,b,c,d",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " we have:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9725308360604*^9, 3.972530846190295*^9}, {
   3.9725310457076473`*^9, 3.972531060581724*^9}, {3.972531095931815*^9, 
