   3.974338864636691*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3770729d-7632-423e-9871-\
a5b85155ef3d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Use one of the predefined graphs as example, here the ",
 StyleBox["complete Kary tree",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " (the name doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t matter, it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s pretty \
obvious what it is):"
}], "Text",
